mintcam (0.2.5) noble; urgency=medium

  * Copy the last photo to the clipboard with a button or Ctrl+Shift+C, and
    reveal the last file in the file manager. Both work on images; for a video
    the folder is opened instead, since a video cannot go to the clipboard.
    The four previous share buttons opened a web page and left the file to the
    user (Telegram and Discord got only the file name, one of them opened the
    project releases), so they are gone.
  * Warn before recording when the free space is low, instead of letting the
    recording die in the middle because ffmpeg or the writer hit the wall.
  * Watch the camera device list every five seconds, so unplugging or
    replugging a webcam updates the selector and the app falls back to a
    working camera instead of staying stuck on a dead one.
  * The recording timer already showed the elapsed time; it now also stays in
    sync after a pause.

 -- Alex Mirici <hilliedmikerano@gmail.com>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:10:00 +0200

